# Build-context allowlist for Dockerfile. Deny everything, then allow only
# the sources the image build reads. Version control, local state, agent
# configuration, credentials, briefs and documentation never enter the
# context. `imagecheck context` verifies the result (docs/container-image.md).
*
!go.mod
!cmd/herdr-soho
!internal
!skills/herdr-soho
!container/runners/package.json
!container/runners/package-lock.json

# Re-exclude what the allowed trees hold but the build does not need.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
internal/testutil
skills/herdr-soho/scripts
**/.*
